{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12mini_level_act12mini_st03",
  "groupId": "act12mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "我曾凝望",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12mini/level_act12mini_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "44cf5565c943cf15a1813dd587e8a03e8b88ebdfe2444d9a6ad45ce53f64dfa9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_courtyard"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瑪恩納·臨光啟：\n久疏問候，或許在大騎士領的生活過於忙碌，令你無暇顧及舊友的往來書信。我尊重你的選擇，希望你一切順利。\n騎士團有許多逸事，如有機會再次小聚，我樂意當面講給你聽。我所行仍與我的理想相去甚遠，但我並未後悔。\n我不想在客套的寒暄上浪費太多筆墨，我會坦白地告訴你，我寫這封信給你的原因：\n瑟莉娜被逮捕了，送往了大騎士領。\n她是我見過最忠誠、高尚的騎士，是我的戰友，也是我的摯愛。我無須多言。\n你一定記得她，記得她的紅髮和紅色的信號彈，她無論何時都能令人舒展眉頭的笑聲。\n她那麼多次為我們從死地中探尋出生路，我決不能接受她先離我們而去。\n我以騎士的榮耀起誓，瑟莉娜是無辜的。她的正直刺痛了那些滿心陰翳的政客與商人。\n像這樣一名騎士，絕不該成為政治和商業把戲的犧牲品。\n如果是面對外敵，無論是烏薩斯的盾衛或是萊塔尼亞的法術騎士，我都會毫不猶豫地向敵陣發起衝鋒。戰鬥至我的盔甲破碎，長槍折斷。\n但是面對國民院，面對商業聯合會，我卻無能為力。\n瑪恩納，很抱歉打擾你平靜的生活。但是我已經嘗試過其他所有方法，現在我只能求助於你。\n這些我無法親自提交的證據，我懇求你替我轉交，以證明她的清白。\n因為你是我的朋友，因為你是“臨光”。\n瑪恩納，我並非出於私情才懇求你的幫助。\n我只是想請求一位高尚的騎士，去拯救另一名高尚的騎士。\n故友切斯柏敬上\n信是打開過的，又被原樣裝回了信封。\n和其他許多文件混在一起，收進了雜亂的櫃子裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G07"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下面插播一條社會新聞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "日前發生在新城區的感染者暴動，以及移動城市入口附近感染者惡意傷人、衝撞警衛事件，主要謀劃者澤諾·舍爾文已於今日自首。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "犯罪嫌疑人為蓋爾工業實行的“感染者幫扶計畫”中招募的工人。本人聲稱是長時間對生活不滿，才策劃了近期的暴動......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "負責新城區主要建設工作的蓋爾工業表示，會儘快完成受損房屋的重建以及對居民的安撫工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "並且加強治安管理，以杜絕類似事件再次發生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在此也提醒各位市民，如需出城，請做好安全防護措施。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望大家保持冷靜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圍觀的路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說什麼給感染者提供工作，到頭來全是普通人遭殃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圍觀的路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不是蓋爾工業提供了工作，這些人已經在城外被鉗獸吃了吧？還敢說對生活不滿？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圍觀的路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要我說就根本不該讓他們進城，感染者沒有一個好東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圍觀的路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在他們進來了，就會想著把他們的同夥也帶進來。看看最近這些事吧，他們連警衛都不放在眼裡了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "新聞上說，他是自首的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不會是他幹的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也不願意相信，可到底是為什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G10"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩天前\n11月27日 2:00 P.M.\n茨沃涅克新城區，建設區域"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前面是死胡同！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這扇門......還能擋住一些......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人很多，我沒辦法支撐太久......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還是不明白，他們為什麼要攻擊我們？我剛剛說錯什麼話了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......你剛剛根本沒來得及說話，這些人的行為，看起來更像是無差別襲擊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒記錯的話，我們接到的任務應該是“接觸卡西米爾邊境城鎮中正在成形的感染者組織”，而不是“平息當地的感染者暴亂”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大概是情報的時間差。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是我們來到羅德島後的第一個正式任務吧，羅德島平時要處理的問題，都是這麼困難嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比起在賽場上解決單一的敵人，確實是要複雜一些......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在怎麼辦......迫不得已的話，先打出去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島員工守則中寫過，在外勤任務中如遇到與感染者的突發衝突，首先要保持基本的克制......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在可不是背誦工作手冊的時候吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二位！請跟我來，往這邊跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱情的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......跑到這裡應該就差不多了吧，大部分人還是不知道這條還沒有建好的通道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......謝、謝啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請問，您為什麼會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱情的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們就是灰毫騎士和焰尾騎士吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱情的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "灰毫騎士！我可是您的鐵杆粉絲！您的每場比賽我都有看的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱情的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，您手裡拿的，就是您打敗鏽銅騎士時用的那門炮吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱情的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還記得那場比賽，最後您饒了“鏽銅”英格拉一命，然後對天空鳴了一炮，對不對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱情的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實在是太帥了！和電視上看到的一模一樣，不對，實物看起來還要更大一點。我、我可以摸一下嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，小灰，在離大騎士領這麼遠的地方都能遇見你的粉絲呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱情的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了！還有焰尾騎士，我也很喜歡您！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈......倒也不用刻意強調我啦，我不會嫉妒的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請問，你是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱情的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉抱歉，我太激動了，還沒來得及自我介紹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱情的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我叫澤諾。也是來茨沃涅克打工的感染者。其實準確來說，也算是一個工頭吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們之前聽說了茨沃涅克有感染者正在成立互助會，您也是其中一員嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道該怎麼說......其實本來這裡的感染者都只能生活在城市外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前段時間，蓋爾工業在這裡開始建設新城區，需要很多人手，也雇傭了一些感染者進城來幹活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一開始，大家都覺得搶到了難得的工作機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但慢慢地，能聽到的抱怨聲越來越多，很多人都覺得，我們和身旁的普通人待遇差別太大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然我們本來就不可能與普通人相比較，但就像血騎士給感染者騎士打出了一條生路那樣，有些事情值得試試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，那個時候我還很支持大家為此組織起來，向蓋爾工業提出抗議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是再後來......事情就像你們看到的一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，暴動的、發動襲擊的，都是蓋爾工業招來的感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，已經不完全是了，我也不知道那裡都有誰......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我甚至不知道......他們是怎麼想到這麼多暴力手段的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這根本不是辦法，只會讓感染者的處境越來越糟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小灰，你有沒有覺得，聽起來像是有人在故意煽動......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，不過一切都快過去啦。二位這幾天小心就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......“快過去了”？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，你們為什麼會到茨沃涅克來？是旅遊嗎？還是有表演賽？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實，我們已經不再做競技騎士了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們現在正在與一家致力於治癒礦石病的製藥公司合作。儘管換了工作，但幫助更多感染者的理想是不會改變的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次前來，也正是想瞭解一下這裡的感染者們的生活狀況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然這次的事態的確有點超乎我們的想像就是了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你是騎士競技的粉絲的話，恐怕我們要做的事會讓你失望了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是什麼話？誰會喜歡看那些只會靠大價錢買裝備的騎士老爺的花架子功夫呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我喜歡紅松騎士團，就是喜歡你們暴揍那些目中無人的貴族，替感染者出氣的樣子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然已經讓他們知道了感染者的厲害，也沒必要一直留在賽場上打打殺殺的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們能在其他方面做一些幫助感染者的事情，我替你們高興還來不及呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果真的有這樣一家醫療組織在為治療感染者努力，那我真是......真是......唉！我可真不敢想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "話說回來，雖然還是有些不好意思，但實在是機會難得......灰毫騎士，可以請您給我簽個名嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當......當然！稍、稍等我一下。呃......抱歉，手頭好像沒有紙也沒有筆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，我還隨身帶著一張耀騎士的簽名，不如把這個送給你吧，你應該會更喜歡這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用在意，我還有和耀騎士打招呼的機會的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝您的好意，但是，可以的話，我還是更想要灰毫騎士的簽名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為......為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "耀騎士的確是很偉大的騎士，強大，正直......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是看到像您這樣的騎士站在競技場上，對我們普通的感染者來說，更是一種鼓舞吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "索娜，你的劍借我用一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喏，你要幹什麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——用劍在頭盔上刻了名字？真、真有你的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "簽得不太像樣，但還是能看清楚的吧......不嫌棄的話，還請收下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（難過的神情）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非常感謝您......但這個禮物，實在是太貴重了。我不能收下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係！今天有機會見到灰毫騎士和焰尾騎士本人，我已經非常開心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我現在還有一些工作必須要去做......有一個請求，如果可以的話，請二位不要對任何人提起見過我的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我該走了。希望我們還有機會再見面！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G07"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暴動發生的時候，他正和我們在一起，絕不可能是他。但......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實你也有些害怕，澤諾真的就是策劃了這場暴動的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些大企業永遠掌握著新聞報導權，抹殺一個人的聲音對他們來說甚至算不上需要耗費精力的事......可疑的地方太多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，在經歷了那麼多事情後，感染者無論採取多麼極端的手段，似乎都不能說“難以置信”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是，不希望他是這樣的人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......我的直覺也是這麼跟我說的，澤諾他不會做出這種事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然這麼關心的話，那麼就先忘掉羅德島員工守則，用紅松騎士團的方式一探究竟吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要動作快一點，就不會被發現啦。博士也一定可以理解的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你說，怎麼查？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果澤諾真的是這起襲擊的主謀，他現在會被怎麼處置？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種級別的事故，應該已經送往大騎士領，由國民院處理了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，如果澤諾沒有被送去大騎士領，而是被藏在了別的地方，是不是就說明這整個事件另有隱情呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "茨沃涅克面積當然比不上大騎士領，但想找一個被藏起來的人，似乎也有點困難......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這也不難，就像我們過去常做的那樣，先投石問路......如果托蘭之前說的話還作數，那我們也許能找到賞金獵人打聽一下情報。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "索娜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不，我大概只是眼花了，感覺好像看到一個熟悉的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我們先行動起來吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G07"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "象徵卡西米爾與萊塔尼亞友好建交的建築“騎士之聲”即將竣工，剪綵儀式預期於十二月一日舉行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊塔尼亞訪問團代表狄洛夫伯爵屆時將親自到場，發表講話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來自萊塔尼亞的明星騎士，“燭騎士”薇薇安娜表示，很遺憾無法在剪綵儀式當天來到現場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是她會以場外連線的方式，為兩國友誼送上祝福......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣著華麗的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好像很中意這座雕塑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣著華麗的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉貿然向您搭話，我只是來這裡旅遊的遊客。見您一個人在這座雕塑前站了很久，這才忍不住來和您交流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣著華麗的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我個人十分欣賞這件藝術品。它的作者是萊塔尼亞一位卓越的雕塑師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣著華麗的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "盾牌變形為樂譜，槍劍與法杖則組成了音符——美好的寓意由絕妙的設計呈現。您覺得呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "騎士的武器與甲胄不僅可以作為裝飾來消費，還能當作樂器為短暫的和平擊節唱誦，的確是件方便的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣著華麗的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您似乎認為，騎士的劍盾不應奏出這樣平緩典雅的樂章。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它們甚至沒有聲音，遑論開口歌唱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣著華麗的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，和平與交流，總是好過戰爭與對立的，對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但願人們能夠認清眼下和平的代價與價值。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣著華麗的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再次恕我冒昧。請問，您之前是軍人嗎？不，按卡西米爾的說法，應該叫，征戰騎士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......為什麼這麼問？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣著華麗的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......萊塔尼亞人對這座城市有特殊的認知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣著華麗的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "茨沃涅克，“商隊鈴響的終點站”，卡西米爾南部邊境線上的要塞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣著華麗的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕是在這麼多年的和平之後，這座城市的角落裡仍然藏著曾經哨站與炮塔的骸骨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣著華麗的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而當年......即使在萊塔尼亞最不可一世、戰爭野心最為膨脹的時候，軍隊也從不曾嘗試正面跨過這座軍事重鎮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣著華麗的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那時高塔術師的精銳不得不繞遠道潛入，遠征者十不存一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣著華麗的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——這都是三十多年前，甚至更久遠的事情了。大多數人可觸摸不到這些傷疤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣著華麗的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我很好奇您的看法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......如果來這裡的遊客都像您一樣嚴謹，茨沃涅克市政府恐怕就需要花費更多的精力來裝點門面了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是您認錯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和您一樣，也只是一個路過的遊客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於我的看法......這座雕塑置於卡西米爾，它滑稽得還不夠出彩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "焰尾騎士？灰毫騎士？你們怎麼會來這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然讓我們猜對啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在蓋爾工業負責建設的城區裡，幾個穿著便衣的打手專門守著一棟還沒有封頂的樓，是不是有些欲蓋彌彰了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過只有那幾個人的話，當然是擋不住我們的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡很危險......你們來的路上看到的那些人，恐怕只是很少一部分守衛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大部隊隨時可能到這裡來，你們趕快離開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們是來帶你一起走的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然還不知道蓋爾工業想搞什麼鬼，但如果他們真的想抓暴亂的始作俑者，還是請嚴格走法律程式吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們可不能對他們的私刑袖手旁觀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那場暴動，不是你指使的，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "灰毫騎士，焰尾騎士。非常感謝你們能為我這個只見過一面的人做到這一步......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，我不能走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噓......小灰，有腳步聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不管怎樣，至少先脫離這些人的掌控。澤諾，跟我們走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們很清楚城市會如何讓感染者消失。你不能留在他們手裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這可能只是一個開端......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "焰尾騎士，灰毫騎士，我真的很崇拜你們，也很感謝你們為感染者所做的這一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我這輩子都無法成為像你們一樣的騎士，在萬眾矚目的地方為感染者而戰......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我生命最大的價值，就是讓我的家人生活得更好一點......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你到底在說什麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小灰，來不及了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我們一定會再見面的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，還有人在追嗎？......應該暫時安全了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起，我剛才有些衝動了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有責怪你的意思啦......只是先冷靜一點，我們至少要從頭理一理情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——誰？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "焰尾的劍很快。在聽到腳步聲的一瞬間，細劍如流星般刺向身後，但是卻未能刺出多少距離。\n劍刃被牢牢握在了戴著臂甲的手裡，焰尾想要將劍抽回都做不到。\n直到陰影中的那人鬆開了手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這就是競技場上的鬧劇養出的“騎士”嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毫無判斷力地貿然出劍，無異於送命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈......看來先前在廣場附近，真的不是我眼花了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我認得您，您就是臨光家的家長，耀騎士的叔叔吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然在大騎士領沒有機會與您對話，但後來我們從羅德島幹員那裡聽說，您當時也出手保護了感染者。真的非常感謝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我並沒有做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們也聽耀騎士說，您的劍術絕不遜色於她，但是您只有特別生氣的時候才會動手，所以我們可能沒機會向您請教......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......“紅松”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們為什麼會出現在待建的新城區？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，我們是應羅德島的委託，來幫助這裡的感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟這和我們成立紅松騎士團的初衷也差不多嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一開始我們還以為，會很得心應手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......只不過到達這裡後才發現，事情好像比我們想像的還要麻煩一點......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......事情就是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......蓋爾工業？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您也知道它？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是打過幾次交道，沒有什麼特別的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，如果要說欺壓感染者這方面，他們確實沒什麼特別的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，您又為什麼會來這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......只是來看看這座城市究竟在發生什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔，難道您也是為感染者暴動的事情而來？那我們這次可以請您幫忙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒有說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然啦，我們的計畫不會是跟蓋爾工業雇傭的整支安保部隊正面衝突。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然我們的目標是救下澤諾先生，但是事情發展到這一步，他不肯逃走的隱情，或許才是我們解決這裡感染者暴動問題的關鍵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......至少我希望是這樣啦！畢竟他是這裡最願意與我們溝通的感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我從來沒有說過，我站在支持感染者的立場上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但無論是否事關感染者，這都是一場明目張膽的陷害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不該再有更多人成為政治和商業把戲的犧牲品了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瑪恩納突然回頭望向身後。\n紅松的騎士隨著他的視線看過去，但小巷的盡頭空無一人。只有遠處高樓的裝飾性穹頂，霓虹燈在夜色中閃爍著浪漫的酒紅。\n不知道這位臨光是來這裡做什麼的，焰尾想道。他連一把武器都沒帶在身邊——不過他需要的話，自己的劍也可以借給他呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“犧牲品”總會不斷出現......或許你我都已經是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我會去確認一些事情。然後，“紅松”，到時我有些問題要問你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G10"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是你們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說過，我們會再見面的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉......不，謝謝你們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次不用謝我們，要謝就謝這位瑪恩納先生好啦。是他說服蓋爾工業取消對您的控告的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝您......您、您是哪位大企業家？或者是貴族老爺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不，我只是個普通的公司職員罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是最近恰好遇見過蓋爾工業的人，對他們的業務發展意向稍有耳聞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（臨光家......原來還有這方面的人才嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我真的不理解，我這麼一個普通的感染者，哪裡值得你們為我做這麼多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在正義面前，沒有什麼值得不值得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要在我們的能力範圍內，對所有不公義的事情，我們都要挺身而出！這就是紅松騎士團的團訓！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼時候有的這條團訓？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在剛剛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好吧。你沒說錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "澤諾，你說的“用自己給家人換來更好的生活”是什麼意思？還有你之前，為什麼要讓我們裝作沒有見過你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是不是蓋爾工業威脅你，讓你擔下暴動主謀的罪名？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不該說的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焰尾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪恩納先生既然已經和蓋爾工業談好了條件，說明他們不打算再為難你啦。不用有顧慮的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那，那我就說了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澤諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_626_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......就如你們所想，最近的感染者暴動事件，蓋爾工業受到多方施壓，需要給出一個交代......而我家裡很需要他們開出的那筆酬金。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
